{"id":"u-6c104513-a797-485c-8ec3-ce0d19733b64","src":"community","title":"Candito 6 week Lower+Nuckols 3x Int Bench+UB Vol","author":"Dr. Yellowhab","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/3lcGyV-candito-6week-lower-nuckols-3x-int-bench-upper","desc":"Candito's 6 week program is great for Squat/Deadlift growth, but mediocre Bench performance is a known issue. From a Powerlifter's POV, putting Bench at lowest priority is sensible as it impacts your total the least of the three movements.\nFor someone looking to improve their SBD and tack on some additional UB volume, this should work well.\nThe movements outside of Bench on UB days are the only addition from me, everything else is straight from Candito 6 Week or Nuckols 3x Int Bench. Remove if not applicable, feel free to change for alternatives, whatever floats your boat so long as it does not negatively impact your bench performance. If direct tricep work hampers your bench performance, remove it. If it doesn't, keep it. You can also reduce volume, increase volume, etc. Personally I find 2 sub-maximal sets provide sufficient volume while also not affecting Bench performance, but you may have an entirely different experience, and that's fine. Tailor it as you need it.\nI personally run this program, and I haven't spontaneously combusted yet, so it's pretty good I guess.\nPlease ensure you deload after the program is completed.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":5,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-17T15:57:19.355Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper 1","Lower 1","Upper 2","Lower 2","Upper 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":75,"x":5}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Plate Loaded)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]}